Core/Jessie: Did you ever think about leaving? The city, I mean?
Core/Rose: Every day at first.
Core/Jessie: What stopped you?
Core/Rose: I didn’t know where to go. And I kept thinking… maybe someone would come back. Maybe there’d be rescue teams, or…
Core/Rose: I don’t know. I just stayed.
Core/Jessie: I’m glad you did.
Core/Rose: …Me too.